{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44278","headline":"左名场自泽州至京使人传语 · 鱼玄机","name":"左名场自泽州至京使人传语","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲居作赋几年愁，王屋山前是旧游。\n诗咏东西千嶂乱，马随南北一泉流。\n曾陪雨夜同欢席，别後花时独上楼。\n忽喜扣门传语至，爲怜邻巷小房幽。\n相如琴罢朱弦断，双燕巢分白露秋。\n莫倦蓬门时一访，每春忙在曲江头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鱼玄机","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44278.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44278","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}